Pass OSC 7501 program status reports to the embedder.

Claude Code, Codex and other CLIs report what they are doing through OSC
7501, the program status protocol. At the pin only libghostty-vt reads it:
the app surfaces' stream handler drops every report and leaves the `?`
support query unanswered, so Claude Code, which asks first, never reports.

This answers the query with the parser's own reply and hands each report to
the apprt as GHOSTTY_ACTION_PROGRAM_STATUS, every key the parser reads
passed on, its title and msg decoded and its strings valid for the call. A
full reset passes on a clear with no id, as the specification asks.

Written for Multishell, cut as a `git diff` against the ThirdParty/ghostty pin
with 0001 to 0006 applied.

